# Survey this machine: what is on screen, where the cursor is, what is running.
# Read-only - it looks and reports, and never touches the mouse or keyboard.
#   hawk.exe --file examples\screen-survey.hawk

log Starting a read-only survey of the desktop

monitors
windows 15
cursor

shot survey-full.png
region 0 0 400 200 survey-topleft.png

pixel 10 10
pixel 800 450

log Survey finished - see shots\survey-*.png
